# Drive 복사(원격 삭제 없음) — 원격 루트 = .env의 BTCFUT_DRIVE_REMOTE(이 봇 전용 폴더 · E2E 폴더 거부)
[Unit]
Description=BTC_Futures_E2E Drive copy (shards rclone copy --checksum --min-age 90s, sqlite online backup)
After=network-online.target
OnFailure=btcfut-failed@%n.service

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=%h/BTC_Futures_E2E
EnvironmentFile=%h/BTC_Futures_E2E/.env
ExecStart=%h/BTC_Futures_E2E/.venv/bin/python -m ops.drive_sync --var-dir %h/BTC_Futures_E2E/var
Nice=15
IOSchedulingClass=idle
TimeoutStartSec=2h
